			"notes": "## What's changed\n\n- Added a second NoFall method, `movement_rewrite`, while keeping `status_packet` as the default. The new method preserves each ordinary movement packet's position/rotation shape and changes only its grounded flag.\n- Fixed AutoWalk continuing to force movement in inventories and other screens when **Stop on GUI** is enabled.\n- Fixed AutoSprint continuing through open screens, including when **Always** mode is enabled.\n- Kept InventoryWalk as the explicit opt-in for movement in live-world screens and preserved Twerk's documented live-container behavior.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Full Gradle test, source-style, client-only architecture, checksum, dependency-report, and release-bundle checks passed from a clean build.\n- GitHub's hosted build and real client GameTest jobs passed for the release commit.\n\n**Full changelog:** https://github.com/erivgout/helikon/compare/v1.8.0...v1.9.0"
